  "html": "<div id=\"question-335460\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">6.</span><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"335460\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Select the correct options in the statement below that describe an <strong>unstable</strong> equilibrium point.</p>\n</div><div id=\"questionBody-335460\" class=\"questionBody\"><div id=\"selectList-335460-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335460-0\" style=\"width: 57px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">Some</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">Some</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">All</div></div></div> solutions that start\n<div id=\"selectList-335460-1\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335460-1\" style=\"width: 136px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">arbitrarily close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">arbitrarily close to</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">far from</div></div></div>\nthe equilibrium\n<div id=\"selectList-335460-2\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame incorrectSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-335460-2\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">remain close to</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">eventually move away from</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">remain close to</div></div></div>\nthe equilibrium.</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answer